  "label": "Antisemitic Trope: Call for Eradication or Elimination",
  "description": "This trope implies that the targeted group (in this case, Jewish people or Israel) must be destroyed or eliminated because they are seen as a 'cancer' or 'disease'. The phrase 'worst cancer I've ever seen' implies a desire for eradication, which is a core element of antisemitic hate speech and can incite violence or support for harmful actions.",
